<title>GERMANY: Bilfinger wins big Bangkok order.</title>
<headline>Bilfinger wins big Bangkok order.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction company Bilfinger + Berger AG said on Wednesday it has won a 350 million mark share of a 1.4 billion mark order to build an underground railway in Bangkok.</p>
<p>The order consists of planning and building an 11 km underground rail route with nine underground stations.</p>
<p>Bilfinger is leader of the project which will include Thai and Japanese partners and will be completed by the year 2001.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
